{"sequence":110,"timestamp":1785486457.8418155,"event":"report.ready","mission_id":"m-72380fa561e6","payload":{"title":"Geometry study: B-52 Stratofortress-class airframe","abstract":["We took B-52 Stratofortress-class airframe through surface check, meshing, and a steady solve to establish whether the chain yields a trustworthy force.","The mesh reached 193,880 cells at max non-orthogonality 54.3\u00b0 and max skewness 3.91; drag settled at 0.0472 \u00b1 1.2e-05.","Solved with OpenFOAM, steady RANS with k-omega SST, on a mesh gated against the published acceptance band."],"methods":["Surface intake and check on B-52 Stratofortress-class airframe.","Meshed to 193,880 cells; quality gated at 70\u00b0 non-orthogonality and 4 skewness.","300 steady iterations on the gated mesh.","Forces averaged over the final fifth of the iteration history; the band is the spread of that window."],"results":[{"quantity":"Mesh","value":"193,880 cells","envelope":"max non-orthogonality 54.3\u00b0 vs 70\u00b0 gate (pass), max skewness 3.91 vs 4.0 guidance (pass)","tier":"SOLVER-BACKED","reason":""}],"uncertainty":["Reported band: settling spread of the coefficient over the averaging window, a floor, not a bound.","Numerical uncertainty from a 3-mesh refinement study: \u00b10.0063 on Cd; successive Cd increments GROW with refinement instead of shrinking; ladder not in the asymptotic range, conservative band, largest spread times 1.25.","No published comparison exists for this body, so the magnitude stands on the solve's own evidence."],"next_investigations":["Drag build-up under yaw: sweep the approach angle and map how the force builds as the body meets the flow off-axis","Resolve the shedding: an unsteady solve of the wake the steady picture averages away, the spectrum, not just the mean force","Next body in the class: take the same gated chain to the nearest unsolved body in the library and grow the validated set"],"compute":{"spent_core_minutes":0.25,"saved_core_minutes":0.0,"efficiency":0.0,"full_fidelity":true,"notes":["spent 0.3 core-min \u00b7 simpleFoam (15s)"]},"plots":[{"title":"Drag history with envelope","file":"Cd_envelope.png","url":"/api/plot/geometry-study/Cd_envelope.png"},{"title":"Lift history with envelope","file":"Cl_envelope.png","url":"/api/plot/geometry-study/Cl_envelope.png"}]}}
